---
import FarmLayout from '../../layouts/FarmLayout.astro';
---

<FarmLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Farm Direct Gwalior"
  description="How Farm Direct collects, uses, and protects customer delivery coordinates and phone details for agricultural pre-orders in Gwalior."
  canonicalPath="/farm/privacy"
>
  <div class="fd-container py-12 sm:py-16 max-w-4xl">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#c48a3f] font-bold bg-[#fdf6ec] px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
        Transparency & Trust
      </span>
      <h1 class="fd-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-[#152317] mt-3">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#536354] mt-2">
        Last updated: October 2026 • Farm Direct Gwalior, Madhya Pradesh
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-[#e0e8dc] shadow-sm space-y-8 text-sm text-[#3b473c] leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#152317]">1. Our Core Privacy Commitment</h2>
        <p>
          Farm Direct operates as a direct-from-farm agricultural initiative connecting our village farmland near Gwalior with families in designated neighbourhood clusters like Pawan Nagar and Chetakpuri.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, monetize, or broker your personal information. We collect only what is strictly necessary to weigh, bag, transport, and deliver raw farm produce to your doorstep.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#152317]">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Contact Details:</strong> Your full name, 10-digit Indian mobile number, and optional email address.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Delivery Coordinates:</strong> Your house/flat number, apartment/colony landmark, and selected Gwalior neighbourhood cluster (e.g. Pawan Nagar, Chetakpuri).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Order Details:</strong> Pre-ordered quantities of raw grains (wheat), pulses (chana, moong, urad), oilseeds (groundnut), or free sample requests.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Account Credentials:</strong> If you register an account, your password is encrypted using high-iteration PBKDF2 password hashing before storage. We never store plaintext passwords.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#152317]">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Harvest Allocation:</strong> Planning weekly crop threshing and packaging based on cluster order tallies.</li>
          <li><strong>Vehicle Routing:</strong> Consolidating delivery vehicle trips from the village farm to Gwalior neighbourhoods to minimize transport overhead.</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp Notifications:</strong> Sending automated order confirmation slips, delivery day reminders, and direct driver arrival alerts to your WhatsApp number.</li>
          <li><strong>Sample Abuse Prevention:</strong> Verifying fair distribution of free sample packets (limiting requests to 1 packet per variety and 2 per round per household).</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#152317]">4. Communications via WhatsApp</h2>
        <p>
          When you place a pre-order or request a tasting sample, we generate a formatted order summary sent to our farm operations WhatsApp (+91 8770767272) and provide a one-tap link for you to connect directly with the farmer. We do not use third-party marketing SMS blasts or automated promotional robo-calls.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#152317]">5. Data Storage & Security</h2>
        <p>
          All application data resides in distributed Cloudflare D1 SQL databases with strict access controls. Client authentication uses secure, encrypted, HttpOnly session cookies scoped strictly to <code class="text-xs bg-[#f0f4ee] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[#275629]">/farm</code>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#152317]">6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          You have the right to inspect your saved addresses, request account deactivation, or clear your order history by messaging our team on WhatsApp at <strong>+91 8770767272</strong> or emailing <a href="mailto:admin@farmdirect.gwalior" class="text-[#275629] font-bold hover:underline">admin@farmdirect.gwalior</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</FarmLayout>
